# ---------------------------------------------------------------- what the checker collects
TypeInfo is record
TypeInfo purpose "A type: built in (codes 1 to 11, 7 the standard errors), or declared by a module of the program (12 on), with the module's name. kind: 1 built in, 2 standard error, 3 record, 4 enum, 5 list, 6 table, 7 map, 8 operationType. A list keeps its item type, a table its row type, a map its key type and value type, and an operationType its output; a record or enum its first member and how many it has, a table its entity's position and how many rows it has, an operationType its first slot and how many it has, and what it raises; an enum whether it is narrow (stored as a tag and one Int64) and whether no variant carries a payload. slots: how many 64-bit slots a value takes when it is passed to the host, as the LLVM backend flattens it"
TypeInfo typeParameter none
TypeInfo field name syntax.Word
TypeInfo field module syntax.Word
TypeInfo field kind Int64
TypeInfo field item Int64
TypeInfo field value Int64
TypeInfo field plain Bool
TypeInfo field holdsText Bool
TypeInfo field narrow Bool
TypeInfo field tagOnly Bool
TypeInfo field first Int64
TypeInfo field count Int64
TypeInfo field raises Int64
TypeInfo field slots Int64

Types is typeInstance
Types purpose "Every type, numbered from 1 by its position"
Types in none
Types instantiates list.List TypeInfo

TypeNames is typeInstance
TypeNames purpose "The number of every type by its name"
TypeNames in none
TypeNames instantiates map.Map String Int64

MemberInfo is record
MemberInfo purpose "A field of a record or a variant of an enum: the type it belongs to, its name, its type (0 for a variant without payload), its position among the type's members from 0 (a variant's tag), and for a variant with a payload its position among those, from 1"
MemberInfo typeParameter none
MemberInfo field owner Int64
MemberInfo field name syntax.Word
MemberInfo field type Int64
MemberInfo field index Int64
MemberInfo field slot Int64

Members is typeInstance
Members purpose "The fields and variants of every record and enum, each type's together"
Members in none
Members instantiates list.List MemberInfo

ParamInfo is record
ParamInfo purpose "One argument slot of a call target: its name, type, and passing mode (1 copy, 2 lend, 3 lendMutable, 4 give)"
ParamInfo typeParameter none
ParamInfo field slot String
ParamInfo field type Int64
ParamInfo field mode Int64

Params is typeInstance
Params purpose "The argument slots of every call target, each target's together"
Params in none
Params instantiates list.List ParamInfo

TargetInfo is record
TargetInfo purpose "A call target: what it is, the builtin row, operation, or type it belongs to, the member it reads or makes, its slots, its result type (0 for none), and what it raises (0 nothing, 7 a standard error, else an enum's type)"
TargetInfo typeParameter none
TargetInfo field kind TargetKind
TargetInfo field owner Int64
TargetInfo field member Int64
TargetInfo field firstParam Int64
TargetInfo field paramCount Int64
TargetInfo field output Int64
TargetInfo field raises Int64

Targets is typeInstance
Targets purpose "Every call target the module may invoke, by its name"
Targets in none
Targets instantiates map.Map String TargetInfo

OpInfo is record
OpInfo purpose "An operation of the program: its name, its module's name and the module's entities (first, and one past the last), its entity's position, its slots in params, its output and error types (0 for none), the region input its output is owned by, and its maxRecursion bound when it recurses"
OpInfo typeParameter none
OpInfo field name syntax.Word
OpInfo field module syntax.Word
OpInfo field moduleFirst Int64
OpInfo field moduleEnd Int64
OpInfo field entity Int64
OpInfo field firstParam Int64
OpInfo field paramCount Int64
OpInfo field output Int64
OpInfo field raises Int64
OpInfo field owner syntax.Word
OpInfo field owned Bool
OpInfo field depth syntax.Word
OpInfo field recursive Bool

Ops is typeInstance
Ops purpose "Every operation of the module, in source order"
Ops in none
Ops instantiates list.List OpInfo

OpNames is typeInstance
OpNames purpose "The position of every operation by its name"
OpNames in none
OpNames instantiates map.Map String Int64

Owners is typeInstance
Owners purpose "For each entity, the position of the operation it belongs to (a call or region), or -1"
Owners in none
Owners instantiates list.List Int64

ValueInfo is record
ValueInfo purpose "A value of an operation: its name, type, whether `set` may change it, where it comes from (1 constant, 2 let, 3 call result, 4 input, 5 bound by a step, 6 caught error, 7 region), the word that sets it first (a region's maxBytes), and whether a region is released at return"
ValueInfo typeParameter none
ValueInfo field name syntax.Word
ValueInfo field code Int64
ValueInfo field mutable Bool
ValueInfo field origin Int64
ValueInfo field init syntax.Word
ValueInfo field initIsName Bool
ValueInfo field initialized Bool
ValueInfo field released Bool

Values is typeInstance
Values purpose "Every value by name, in the order they are declared"
Values in none
Values instantiates map.Map String ValueInfo

CallInfo is record
CallInfo purpose "A call of an operation: its name, its target, the value of an operationType it calls through (`invokesReference`; its name otherwise), where its arguments start in the argument list and how many, the value it sets, and the name its error is caught as"
CallInfo typeParameter none
CallInfo field name syntax.Word
CallInfo field target TargetInfo
CallInfo field reference syntax.Word
CallInfo field firstArgument Int64
CallInfo field arity Int64
CallInfo field result syntax.Word
CallInfo field hasResult Bool
CallInfo field catchName syntax.Word
CallInfo field hasCatch Bool

Calls is typeInstance
Calls purpose "Every call of an operation by name, in source order"
Calls in none
Calls instantiates map.Map String CallInfo

ArgumentInfo is record
ArgumentInfo purpose "A value a call passes, and the type its slot takes"
ArgumentInfo typeParameter none
ArgumentInfo field value syntax.Word
ArgumentInfo field code Int64

Arguments is typeInstance
Arguments purpose "The arguments of every call of an operation, each call's together"
Arguments in none
Arguments instantiates list.List ArgumentInfo

LabelInfo is record
LabelInfo purpose "A label of an operation: its loop kind (0 none, 1 while, 2 doWhile, 3 counted, 4 forever, 5 forEach), the loop it is within, its maxIterations bound, and what a forEach loop reads"
LabelInfo typeParameter none
LabelInfo field name syntax.Word
LabelInfo field kind Int64
LabelInfo field within syntax.Word
LabelInfo field nested Bool
LabelInfo field bound syntax.Word
LabelInfo field bounded Bool
LabelInfo field over syntax.Word

Labels is typeInstance
Labels purpose "Every label of an operation by name"
Labels in none
Labels instantiates map.Map String LabelInfo

Step is record
Step purpose "One checked step: its label, its verb, and the words it names (the label word where a verb names fewer); a case keeps the member it matches and the type it binds (0 for none)"
Step typeParameter none
Step field label syntax.Word
Step field verb StepVerb
Step field subject syntax.Word
Step field target syntax.Word
Step field otherwise syntax.Word
Step field extra syntax.Word
Step field number Int64
Step field code Int64

Steps is typeInstance
Steps purpose "The steps of an operation in source order"
Steps in none
Steps instantiates list.List Step

Blocks is typeInstance
Blocks purpose "The labels whose steps have been seen, while steps are checked"
Blocks in none
Blocks instantiates map.Map String Int64

