checkOneOperation is operation
checkOneOperation purpose "Check one operation into collections of its own, released when it is checked"
checkOneOperation invariant none
checkOneOperation typeParameter none
checkOneOperation input source String borrowed
checkOneOperation input words syntax.Words borrowed
checkOneOperation input rows syntax.Rows borrowed
checkOneOperation input entities model.Entities borrowed
checkOneOperation input types Types borrowed
checkOneOperation input typeNames TypeNames borrowed
checkOneOperation input members Members borrowed
checkOneOperation input params Params borrowed
checkOneOperation input targets Targets borrowed
checkOneOperation input ops Ops borrowed
checkOneOperation input owners Owners borrowed
checkOneOperation input constants Values borrowed
checkOneOperation input opIndex Int64 copied
checkOneOperation output none
checkOneOperation outputOwnedBy none
checkOneOperation raises syntax.Rejection
checkOneOperation effect none
checkOneOperation uses none
checkOneOperation memoryHeap true
checkOneOperation async false
checkOneOperation maxRecursion none
checkOneOperation label begin loopKind none
checkOneOperation label begin within none
checkOneOperation label checkDone loopKind none
checkOneOperation label checkDone within none
checkOneOperation label checkFailed loopKind none
checkOneOperation label checkFailed within none
checkOneOperation let none
checkOneOperation at begin do newValues
checkOneOperation at begin do newCalls
checkOneOperation at begin do newArguments
checkOneOperation at begin do newLabels
checkOneOperation at begin do newSteps
checkOneOperation at begin do check
checkOneOperation at begin branch ifError check goto checkFailed else goto checkDone
checkOneOperation at checkDone return ok none
checkOneOperation at checkFailed return error checkError

opWork is region
opWork in checkOneOperation
opWork strategy arena
opWork maxBytes 268435456
opWork released atReturn

