diagnose is operation
diagnose purpose "Run the front end on a program's source and describe the first problem, or say it was accepted"
diagnose invariant reportsFirstProblem "\"Returns `accepted` for a program in the subset; otherwise the first problem the lexer, rows, model, or subset check finds, as `line:column: message (word)`\""
diagnose typeParameter none
diagnose input source String borrowed
diagnose input region Region borrowed
diagnose output String
diagnose outputOwnedBy region
diagnose raises none
diagnose effect none
diagnose uses none
diagnose memoryHeap true
diagnose async false
diagnose maxRecursion none
diagnose label begin loopKind none
diagnose label begin within none
diagnose label lexDone loopKind none
diagnose label lexDone within none
diagnose label modelIt loopKind none
diagnose label modelIt within none
diagnose label checkIt loopKind none
diagnose label checkIt within none
diagnose label accepted loopKind none
diagnose label accepted within none
diagnose label lexFailed loopKind none
diagnose label lexFailed within none
diagnose label refusedGroup loopKind none
diagnose label refusedGroup within none
diagnose label refusedModel loopKind none
diagnose label refusedModel within none
diagnose label refusedCheck loopKind none
diagnose label refusedCheck within none
diagnose let acceptedText String "accepted" immutable
diagnose let lexText String "the lexer refused the source" immutable
diagnose at begin do lex
diagnose at begin branch ifError lex goto lexFailed else goto lexDone
diagnose at lexDone do newWords
diagnose at lexDone do newRows
diagnose at lexDone do group
diagnose at lexDone branch ifError group goto refusedGroup else goto modelIt
diagnose at modelIt do newEntities
diagnose at modelIt do newNames
diagnose at modelIt do buildIt
diagnose at modelIt branch ifError buildIt goto refusedModel else goto checkIt
diagnose at checkIt do checkAll
diagnose at checkIt branch ifError checkAll goto refusedCheck else goto accepted
diagnose at accepted return ok acceptedText
diagnose at lexFailed return ok lexText
diagnose at refusedGroup do describeGroup
diagnose at refusedGroup return ok groupText
diagnose at refusedModel do describeModel
diagnose at refusedModel return ok modelText
diagnose at refusedCheck do describeCheck
diagnose at refusedCheck return ok checkText

